OL,3,GNEWSAMy son donated his body to science
OL,4,Aand became a 'silent teacher'          
OL,6,FFifteen years ago Barbara Scott signed 
OL,7,Fdocuments to leave her body to medical 
OL,8,Fscience.                               
OL,10,FHer son Oliver McNeil Scott liked the  
OL,11,Fidea and five years ago he also signed 
OL,12,Fup to the body donation programme.     
OL,14,FBarbara, from Lenzie in East           
OL,15,FDunbartonshire, never thought her son  
OL,16,Fwould go before her - but in April     
OL,17,F2025, Oliver died from colorectal      
OL,18,Fcancer at the age of 48.               
OL,20,FHis body was signed over to the        
OL,21,FUniversity of Edinburgh's medical      
OL,22,Fschool.                                
